WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520
Lowe got so courageous that he attacked his boss in public.

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:03,600
No, I have to kiss you back

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,160
The boss hates it in front of so many people

4
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:08,510
Hahahaha

5
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:10,390
These girls graduated from prestigious schools

6
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:13,150
I am very positive when I meet a truly capable boss.

7
00:00:13,150 --> 00:00:15,710
But what the boss values ​​is ability and propriety.

8
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:17,430
Simply showing kindness is not enough

9
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:19,150
Red vinegar is the stupidest thing to do

10
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:21,070
An annual salary of 3 million, a car and a house

11
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:22,550
My boss trusts me the most

12
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:24,510
As long as we keep the core position of the Great Secretary

13
00:00:24,510 --> 00:00:26,230
No matter what you do, use Fengfeng Red Vinegar

14
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:27,470
I am also invincible

15
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:29,390
Boss, thank you for your generosity

16
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:30,390
I'll toast you

17
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:31,430
Got it

18
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:32,670
Girls, drink less alcohol

19
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:33,790
Just take a bite of rice as you like

20
00:00:33,790 --> 00:00:35,950
No, this is my truth

21
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:41,460
This is a courtesy

22
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,620
Hey wake up

23
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:44,260
If you can't drink, what can you do?

24
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:45,620
Sorry boss

25
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:47,060
I'm just so happy

26
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,580
I usually drink it by the glass

27
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:51,020
Those of you who never dare to drink outside

28
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:52,020
The bonuses have been distributed

29
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:53,260
I have another decision

30
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:55,620
Everyone will be on vacation for half a month starting tomorrow. I want to get busy.
